
# machine translated (German), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Why it asks, in one plain sentence, under the device's name.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
thunder-why = Thunderbolt- und USB4-Geräte können direkt auf den Speicher dieses Computers zugreifen. Lass daher nur Geräte zu, die du kennst und denen du vertraust.

# Title of the question. $name is the device's name.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
thunder-let-connect = { $name } verbinden lassen?

# The device's name when it has none.
thunder-no-name = Ein Thunderbolt-Gerät

# Under the device's name when its maker did not say who it is.
thunder-no-maker = Der Hersteller hat nicht angegeben, wer er ist.

# Under the device's name: who made it. $maker is the maker's name.
thunder-made-by = Hergestellt von { $maker }.

# Warning under the question when the device gives the name of one allowed before, but cannot be proved to be it.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
thunder-doubt = Es gibt den Namen eines Geräts an, das du früher erlaubt hast, kann aber nicht beweisen, dass es dieses Gerät ist.

# Button that refuses the device.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
thunder-never = Nicht erlauben

# Button that lets the device in this time only.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
thunder-once = Dieses Mal erlauben

# Button that lets the device in every time.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
thunder-always = Immer erlauben

# Red words under the question when the device could not be connected.
thunder-not-connected = Es konnte nicht verbunden werden.

# Red words under the question when it could not be connected after it was unplugged and plugged in again.
thunder-unplug = Es konnte nicht verbunden werden. Ziehe es ab und stecke es wieder an, um es noch einmal zu versuchen.

# Red words under the question when the part of Trindle that answers for the guard is not running.
thunder-guard-silent = Der Thunderbolt-Wächter von Trindle antwortet gerade nicht.
